Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 19:55:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] phase-6: console — base layout, design system, and dashboard

Implements the zero-dependency Go/HTMX console UI.
Introduces the Omnea-inspired design system (CSS Grid, huge serifs, hairline borders)
and Apple-style interaction physics (transform scaling, translucent materials).

Refs: SEC-05, Master Spec 3.7
